@startuml
title U7 - Call Next Customer & Complete Service

start

:Staff selects "Call Next Customer";
:System retrieves next customer (appointment/queue);

if (Customer available?) then (Yes)
  :Display customer details;
  :Update status to "In Service";
  :Perform service;
  :Staff selects "Complete Service";
  :Remove customer from active queue (if any);
else (No)
  :Show "No customer available" message;
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. Staff chooses the option to call the next customer.
2. System gets the next customer from the appointment list or virtual queue.
3. System checks if there is an available customer to serve.
4. If available, system displays the customer’s details to staff.
5. System updates the customer/service status to "In Service".
6. Staff provides the service.
7. System updates the status to "Completed".
8. System removes the customer from the active queue if they came from the queue.
9. If no customer is available, system shows a message indicating none are waiting.
end note

@enduml